cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or these results, please cite the paper."
title: "Representation, Not Model Family, Determines the Explanation: code and per-fold results"
abstract: >-
  Code and per-fold artefacts for a controlled study of what governs a feature
  attribution in credit risk models. Four controls separate the attribution
  measure, the feature representation and the model family from one another on
  two public benchmarks.
